    "activityText": "Activity 56K followers Reactions No more previous content Marques Brownlee liked this Marques Brownlee liked this Isaac Attuah Isaac Attuah 6y Marques Brownlee liked this It was both emotional and awesome to see Marques Brownlee finally cross the 10 million mark on YouTube. Over the past decade, he has released videos during his finals week, graduated college and started his own business, interviewed the likes of Bill Gates, Elon Musk and Kobe Bryant, dominated ultimate frisbee and much more. I started watching him in 2014 and since then I have seen how he has grown quickly over the years but still remained true to the MKBHD community. Here are my top 6 lessons from his channel over the past decade: #1 Make content that you will want to watch #2 Don't follow the crowd ; Be honest and be yourself #3 You can disrupt an industry even if you are the minority. #4 Competition breeds innovation #5 Consistency of thought, actions and work breeds results #6 Think.Plan.Execute It is indeed encouraging to have role models who look just like you trailblazing in the industry. Definitely an encouragement to keep working hard and breaking barriers. #marquesbrownlee #mkbhd #keith #youtube No more next content"
